OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers charged with murder of
OL,4,Ae-bike rider
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a teenage boy have been
OL,7,Fcharged with the murder of an e-bike
OL,8,Frider who died in a crash in west
OL,9,FLondon.
OL,11,FKariem Abdelhalim, 24, was found
OL,12,Fseriously injured on North Pole Road,
OL,13,FNorth Kensington, at about 01:20 BST on
OL,14,FFriday 25 September, the Metropolitan
OL,15,FPolice said. He was pronounced dead a
OL,16,Fshort time later.
OL,18,FCharles Egonye, 19, of Wulfstan Street,
OL,19,FEast Acton, and a 17-year-old boy from
OL,20,Fthe Southall area, who cannot be named
OL,21,Ffor legal reasons, were arrested on
OL,22,Fsuspicion of murder on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
